      "updated": 1753382808620,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Given an integer array nums and an integer k, return the number of good subarrays of nums.\n\nA subarray arr is good if there are at least k pairs of indices (i, j) such that i < j and arr[i] == arr[j]",
      "fontSize": 14.235619220770392,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Given an integer array nums and an integer k, return the number of good subarrays of nums.\n\nA subarray arr is good if there are at least k pairs of indices (i, j) such that i < j and arr[i] == arr[j]",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
